{"id":"A1-L097","title":"Adjective position: practice and contrast","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U06","focus":"Adjective position — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Adjective position — prática e contraste","pron":"do you (fala rápida)","verbs":["look"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["round","soft","round table","soft blue shirt","big old book","nice new lamp","thin wooden stick","shape","material","look at","notice the order","describe","new lamp","blue shirt"],"field":"Lazer","genre":"Transcrição de palestra e podcast","skill":"Fala","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 97 · Adjective position: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Adjective position — prática e contraste.","**Verbos:** look.","**Pronúncia:** do you (fala rápida).","**14 palavras novas** (lazer).","**Texto do dia:** transcrição de palestra e podcast."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo contrastar a posição dos adjetivos e usar look em uma palestra."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["round","redondo"],["soft","macio"],["round table","round table"],["soft blue shirt","soft blue shirt"],["big old book","big old book"],["nice new lamp","nice new lamp"],["thin wooden stick","thin wooden stick"],["shape","shape"],["material","material"],["look at","look at"],["notice the order","notice the order"],["describe","describe"],["new lamp","new lamp"],["blue shirt","blue shirt"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A lecture transcript","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Lecture: How to Describe Things","paras":["Let’s **look** at three objects. First, a **small round** table. Second, a **big old** book. Third, a **nice new** lamp.","Notice: opinion first (**nice**), then age (**new**). **Look** at the order. A **soft blue** shirt, not a *blue soft* shirt."],"kicker":"LECTURE TRANSCRIPT","by":"Prof. Ames","gloss":[["round","redondo"],["soft","macio"],["lamp","abajur"],["notice","reparar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The first object is a table.","ans":"T","why":"small round table."},{"q":"The shirt is a “blue soft shirt”.","ans":"F","why":"soft blue."},{"q":"Opinion comes first.","ans":"T","why":"opinion first."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“round” means…","opts":["redondo","quadrado","longo"],"ans":0,"why":"round."},{"q":"“soft” means…","opts":["macio","duro","áspero"],"ans":0,"why":"soft."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Adjective order","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Ordem","Exemplo"],"rows":[["opinião","**nice, great**"],["tamanho","**big, small**"],["idade","**old, new**"],["forma","**round**"],["cor","**blue, red**"]],"cap":"Adjective order"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Exemplo completo: **a nice big old round blue table**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"A ___ blue shirt. (soft/blue soft)","a":"soft","why":"ordem."},{"s":"A ___ book. (big old/old big)","a":"big old","why":"ordem."},{"s":"Let’s ___ at it. (look)","a":"look","why":"look at."},{"s":"A ___ new lamp. (nice/new nice)","a":"nice","why":"ordem."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["round","redondo"],["soft","macio"],["lamp","abajur"],["notice","reparar"],["order","ordem"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["do","you","see","What"],"ans":"What do you see","pt":"O que você vê?"},{"words":["new","lamp","A","nice"],"ans":"A nice new lamp","pt":"Um abajur novo e legal!"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"round","pos":"word","pt":"redondo","ex":"A round table.","expt":"Uma mesa redonda."},{"w":"soft","pos":"word","pt":"macio","ex":"A soft shirt.","expt":"Uma camisa macia."},{"w":"round table","pos":"word","pt":"round table","ex":"mesa redonda","expt":"A round table."},{"w":"soft blue shirt","pos":"word","pt":"soft blue shirt","ex":"camisa azul macia","expt":"A soft blue shirt."},{"w":"big old book","pos":"word","pt":"big old book","ex":"livro grande e velho","expt":"A big old book."},{"w":"nice new lamp","pos":"word","pt":"nice new lamp","ex":"abajur novo e bonito","expt":"A nice new lamp."},{"w":"thin wooden stick","pos":"word","pt":"thin wooden stick","ex":"vareta fina de madeira","expt":"A thin wooden stick."},{"w":"shape","pos":"word","pt":"shape","ex":"forma","expt":"A round shape."},{"w":"material","pos":"word","pt":"material","ex":"material","expt":"A soft material."},{"w":"look at","pos":"word","pt":"look at","ex":"olhar","expt":"Look at this lamp."},{"w":"notice the order","pos":"word","pt":"notice the order","ex":"repare na ordem","expt":"Notice the order."},{"w":"describe","pos":"word","pt":"describe","ex":"descrever","expt":"Describe it."},{"w":"new lamp","pos":"word","pt":"new lamp","ex":"abajur novo","expt":"A new lamp."},{"w":"blue shirt","pos":"word","pt":"blue shirt","ex":"camisa azul","expt":"A blue shirt."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What do you see?** — O que você vê?","**A big old round table.** — Uma grande mesa redonda e velha.","**Look at the lamp.** — Olhe o abajur.","**I’d appreciate it.** — Eu agradeceria.","**Do you mind if I…?** — Você se importa se eu…?","**Would it be possible to…?** — Seria possível…?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"look","pt":"olhar","forms":[["I / you / we / they look","I look at the lamp."],["he / she / it looks","She looks at the book."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Describing","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Describing","lines":[["Ana","What do you see?","O que você vê?"],["Leo","A big old round table.","Uma grande mesa redonda e velha."],["Ana","Look at the lamp.","Olhe o abajur."],["Leo","A nice new lamp!","Um abajur novo e legal!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: do you (fala rápida)","items":[{"label":"do you (fala rápida)","note":"Na fala rápida, do you soa /dʒu/ ou /dəjə/.","words":["Do you like it?","What do you do?","Where do you live?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe three objects.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"A small round table. A big old book. A nice new lamp."},{"q":"Use look at.","pt":"Diga.","model":"Look at the lamp."},{"q":"Correct the order.","pt":"Corrija.","model":"A soft blue shirt."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with two adjectives.","model":"I have a small round table. She has a big old book. It is a nice new lamp. He wears a soft blue shirt. We live in a big white house.","checklist":["Usei **2 adjetivos**","Ordem correta","Usei **be**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “round” mean?","opts":["redondo","macio","reparar"],"ans":0,"why":"**round** = redondo."},{"q":"What does “soft” mean?","opts":["abajur","macio","ordem"],"ans":1,"why":"**soft** = macio."},{"q":"What does “lamp” mean?","opts":["reparar","velho","abajur"],"ans":2,"why":"**lamp** = abajur."},{"q":"What does “notice” mean?","opts":["reparar","ordem","novo"],"ans":0,"why":"**notice** = reparar."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}